        "borana": "Wacayo laftana, goftako! Ho haman nati d'ufe, aka mukni adu narra cabu, ati hama nati cabi, goftako, gadiza na tai!",
        "english": "Good God of this earth, my Lord! When misfortune comes to me, as a tree keeps off the sun from me, mayest thou keep off misfortune, my Lord, be thou my shadow!",
